    wm_host_external_content_owner_2026-07-29, 1, "OWNER QUESTION 2026-11-04 (slice H): overwrite bug is fixed; remaining gate is feature work (scalar host bridge, bounded present slot, pixel-present window-protocol command, remote event receiver). Is remote application presentation in scope for 1.0.0, or move to a feature request and close this row?"
    wm_host_external_content_owner_2026-07-29, 2, "OWNER DECISION 2026-11-26: in scope for 1.0.0. Implemented shared present slot + surface-present/events/input/frame-probe verbs on app.play.wm_daemon; evidence test/03_system/gui/wm_host_platform/wm_remote_app_two_process_spec.spl (3 processes, 24000/24000 known pixels read back, negative controls) and test/02_integration/app/wm_remote_app_presentation_spec.spl (6/6). Status after landing: fix-implemented-verification-pending (follow-ups in the .md)."
    wm_host_external_content_owner_2026-07-29, 3, "2026-11-26 wm-lane-20261126 Linux aarch64 79445b063c4 seed cargo-target-wr-seed1126b: wm_host_content_owner_probe exit 0 (owner scalar fix holds). Pixel-present protocol command, bounded present slot, scalar host bridge, remote event receiver all still absent in src/os. Feature work; owner question of 2026-11-04 still unanswered."

